    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγοητεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bewitch</i>: hence, <i>cheat</i> or <i>blind by
